nanu evamapīśvarādvayavādo na nirvyūḍhastadatiriktāyāḥ 
svātantryaśakterapyabhidhānāt (?) ityāśaṅkyāha(-)


śaktiśca nāma bhāvasya svaṃ rūpaṃ mātṛkalpitam |

tenādvayaḥ sa evāpi śaktimatparikalpane || 1-68 ||


yato bhāvasya (-) yasya kasyacana sataḥ padārthasya(-)svameva rūpaṃ 
