(")ahaṃ hi sarvayajñānāṃ bhoktā ca prabhureva ca |(") 

iti || 132 ||

nanu ekaśca ubhayātmā ca iti kathaṃ saṅgacchatām (?) ityāśaṅkyāha(-)


yājamānī saṃvideva yājyā nānyeti coditam |

na tvākṛtiḥ kuto'pyanyā devatā na hi socitā || 1-133 ||


saṃvideva yājyā(,) iti uditam pratijñātam | na punaḥ kuto'pi hetoḥ 
