ekā tattadātmanā sphurati iti yuktamuktam (-) śa eva 
yājyayaṣṭṭatayoditaḥ(") iti || 133 ||

ata eva ca ādisiddhatvāt saṃvidi na kiñcid vidhyādi siddhinimittamuktam (-) 
ityāha (-) 

vidhiśca noktaḥ ko'pyatra mantrādi vṛttidhāma vā | iha khalu 
vedavākyāni mantrabrahmaṇarūpatvena dvidhā | brahmaṇavākyānyapi 
