ādisiddho bodhaḥ iti siddham ||

nanu yadyevaṃ tatkathamayaṃ jaḍājaḍātmā viśvaprasaraḥ (?) 
ityāśaṅkyāha (-) 


so'yamātmānamāvṛtya sthito jaḍapadaṃ gataḥ || 1-134 ||

āvṛtānāvṛtātmā tu devādisthāvarāntagaḥ |

