śrīśambhunāthaḥ sadbhāvaṃ jāgradādau nyarūpayat ||(")

ityādāvapi jñeyam || 213 ||

idānīṃ śāmbhavamupāyaṃ pratipādya(,) śāktamapyāha (-) 


śākto'tha bhaṇyate cetodhīmanohaṃkṛtiḥ sphuṭam |

savikalpatayā māyāmayamicchādi vastutaḥ || 1-214 ||


