nanu na pratibimbasya vinā bimbaṃ bhavetsthitiḥ |


etadeva pratividhatte (-) 


kiṃ tataḥ pratibimbe hi bimbaṃ tādātmyavṛtti na || 3-59 ||


kiṃ tata iti (-) bimbaṃ cennāsti tataḥ kim(,) na kiñcidapi (-) ityarthaḥ | na 
