brūmaḥ(,) nahi nirnimittameva bhāvānāṃ saṃbhavo nyāyyaḥ (?) 
ityāśaṅkyāha (-) hetumātra ityādi hetuśca dvividhaḥ (-) upādānaṃ 
nimittaṃ ca(,) upādānaṃ yathā ghaṭādau mṛdādi(,) nimittaṃ yathā tatraiva 
daṇḍādi | pratibimbasya ca bimbaṃ nopādānakāraṇam(,) taddhi ghaṭa iva 
