dyotanātmanaścittattvasya(,) tādṛśe viśvapratibimbane(,) jñānakriyādyāḥ 
śaktayo nimittaṃ bhavantu(,) evaṃ na kaściddoṣaḥ saṃbhāvyate
ityarthaḥ | śaktaśca (-) 

(")bahuśaktitvamapyasya tacchaktyaivāviyuktatā |(")

