iti | tasya ca paraiva sā śaktiḥ kulasya śarīrasya yat prathanaṃ tena 
ślāghamānā(,) taccharīrārambhikā (-) ityarthaḥ | ata eva (")kaulikī(") 
ityuktam(,) tathāhi (-) paraiva sūkṣmā kuṇḍalinī śaktiḥ śivena saha 
