(")kṣobhāntarasyāsambhavāt(") ityādinā prāgupādānāddhetoranirdeśaḥ | ata 
eva cāsya varṇacatuṣṭayasya prakṣobhakatvābhāvāt 
svātmamātraviśrāntyā paracamatkāramayatvam || 91 || 

tadāha (-) 


ātmanyeva ca viśrāntyā tatproktamamṛtātmakam |


na kevalameṣāṃ yathāsaṃbhavaṃ prameyena saṅghaṭṭe parāmarśāntarodayo 
yāvat parasparamapi (-) ityāha (-) 


