doṣaḥ(,) teṣāṃ punastatraiva pramāṇatvaṃ na bhavet (-) ādyenaiva 
jñānakṣaṇena apūrvasyārthasya prakāśanāt(,) apūrvārthaprakāśatvameva 
hi nāma pramāṇatvam(,) yadāhuḥ (-) 

