pramāṇānāmavakāśaḥ(") iti (?) (-) ityāśaṅkyāha (-)  


dṛṣṭvā dṛṣṭvā samāśliṣya ciraṃ sañcarvya cetasā |

priyā yaiḥ parituṣyeta kiṃ brūmaḥ kila tānprati || 4-84 ||


dṛṣṭvā dṛṣṭveti (-) ābhīkṣṇyenāśleṣasañcarvaṇayorapi asau 
arthāllabhyate(,) ciraśabdādvā tena rūpajñānātmakaiḥ 
