paritoṣo jāyate(,) tān prati kiṃ brūmaḥ (-) 
pramātrāśvāsaparyantasyādhigamasya ādyeneva jñānakṣaṇena 
utpāde'nubhavavirodhānna kiñcit(,) iti yāvat(,) ataśca 

(")ekasyārthasvabhāvasya pratyakṣasya sataḥ svayam |

ko'nyo na bhāgo dṛṣṭaḥ syādyaḥ pramāṇaiḥ parīkṣyate ||(")

ityādyuktamayuktameva(,) iti bhāvaḥ(,) tena

(")yatrāpi syātparicchedaḥ pramāṇairuttaraiḥ punaḥ |

nūnaṃ tatrāpi pūrveṇa so'rtho nāvadhṛtastathā ||(")

