prāmāṇyamuktaṃ(,) tanna yuktaṃ (-) vyarthatvādidūṣaṇaśatopanipātāt(,) 
tasmādekasminnapi arthe'nekapramāṇapravṛttyātmani saṃplave'pi 
nādhigatasyaiva arthasyādhigamaḥ(,) iti (-) na pramāṇāntarāṇāṃ 
niṣprayojanatvaṃ(,) tairapi (-) apūrvasyārthasya prakāśanāt(,) yadyevaṃ 
