saṃvit(,) bahirmukhī (-) svasvātantryāt pramāṇadaśāmadhiśayānā(,) 
svamātmīyaṃ yaccakṣurādīndriyasaṃbandhi rūpādyālocanātmakaṃ 
vṛtticakraṃ(,) tena samaṃ tathātirekāyamāṇatayā bhāsitaṃ 
yadviśvalakṣaṇaṃ vastu(,) tasya ye 

(")rūpādipañcavargo'yaṃ viśvametāvadeva hi |(")

ityādyuktyā rūpādyā aṃśāḥ tatkartṛkāṃ rañjanām(,) alam(-)atyartham(,) 
