tatraiva yuktileśamāśritya avadhānamātrameva cet kṛtaṃ tadayatnenaiva 
visargabhūḥ samāsāditā bhavet (-) iti ko nāmātra saṃrambho yadasiddhyā 
śāstrarthānuṣṭhānamapyaparyavasitaṃ syāditi || 70 ||

