nimittam (?) (-) ityāśaṅkyāha (-) 


antarlakṣyo bahirdṛṣṭiḥ paramaṃ padamaśnute || 80 ||


iha hi (")bahiḥ(") idantāparāmṛśye dehaghaṭādau

(")tattadrūpatayā jñānaṃ bahirantaḥ prakāśate |

