aprakāśātmakameva nityaparokṣatvāt(,) dīpaśca nimittakāraṇabhūto yadyapi 
bhavanmate parasyeva svasyāpi prakāśakastathāpyavidita evāsau tathā na 
bhavet(,) vedyatvameva ca vicārayitumupakrāntamityarthavadasyāpi 
vārtetyevamuktam | ataścārthaprakāśane samagraiva 
