iha preryaperrakobhayābhiprāyaparamārthastāvat ṇyarthaḥ(,) tatra preryasya 
svātantryeṇa pravṛttakriyatve'pi pāratantryarāmarśalakṣaṇaḥ(,) 
prerakasya ca svatantre'pi perrye samadhigatatatpāratantryasya svātmani 
apekṣaṇīyatāparāmarśalakṣaṇo'bhiprāyaḥ(,) 
