jaḍatvādanusandhiprāṇito'bhiprāyo na saṃbhavati tatrāsau nāstyeva(,) 
lakṣaṇayā tu tatra tatra tathā vyavahartavyo yathā (-) śaraṃ gamayati 
kārīṣo'dhyāpayati vāyuradriṃ pātayatīti || 38 ||

tadāha (-)  


tathāhi gantuṃ śakto'pi caitro'nyāyattatāṃ gateḥ |

