vāyuradriṃ pātayatītyatra dvāvapi tau jaḍau |

draṣṭṛbhiḥ prerakapreryavapuṣā parikalpitau || 10-43 ||


preryaprerakayoriti śaraṃ gamayatīti(,) vāyuradriṃ pātayatīti ca | 
nivṛttimāśaṅkyeti(,) gantuṃ śaktatve'pi audāsīnyādinā kadācinna 
gacchet (-) ityarthaḥ | ataśca gacchatyapi prayojye 
prayojakavyāpāreṇāvaśyabhāvyam (-) iti bhāvaḥ | evamiti(,) 
prayojyaprayojakayorabhiprāyamelanayā (-) ityarthaḥ | tadabhiprāyata iti 
mukhyaṇyartharūpatāmanusandhāya (-) ityarthaḥ | anyo'pi loka iti(,) 
prayojyaprayojakābhyāmaparastaṭastho'pīti yāvat | tatheti 
prayojyaprayojakabhāvena(,) vegākhyasaṃskriyāṃ vidadhaditi(,) 
ākarṣaṇamokṣaṇādāvicchāprayatnādimān dhānuṣkaḥ | ākṛṣṭadhanuṣo 
hi tasya śaramumukṣānantaraprayatnāpekṣātmāṃgulisaṃyogajamaṃgulikarma(,) 
tasmājjyāṃgulivibhāgaḥ(,) tataḥ saṃyogavināśe 
dhanuḥsthasthitasthāpakalakṣaṇasaṃskārāpekṣāt dhanurjyāsaṃyogāt 
jyāyāṃ karma utpadyate(,) tena svakāraṇāpekṣaṃ jyāyāṃ vegākhyaṃ 
saṃskāramādatte(,) tamapekṣamāṇaḥ śarajyāsaṃyoge nodanaṃ bhavati 
