evaṃ hi karmaṇā kramaphaladānātmā svabhāva eva tyakto bhavet | na caitat(,) 
ityubhayathāpi na karmakṣayaḥ siddhyet | tadāha (-) 


na bhogādanyakarmāṃśaprasaṅgo hi duratyayaḥ || 13-8 ||

