na ca karmaphalatve'pi jñānasyeśvarecchopanatameva karmāntaradāhakatvaṃ 
kintu yuktibalopanītam (-) ityāha (-) 


nanvitthaṃ pradahejjñānaṃ karmajālāni karma hi || 13-13 ||

