prāgbhavedityuktam | na cāsminmuktāṇāvutpatsyamānaṃ jñānamevaṃ 
carcyatāṃ kasmānna muktāṇau jñānaṃ bhāvīti || 19 ||

tadāha (-) 


kasmājjñānaṃ na bhāvyatra nanu dehādyajanmataḥ |

