ahetutve cāsya dvitīyakṣaṇaparisaṃkhyāto nāśaḥ(,) 
ityanārabdhaparisamāpta eva saṃsāraḥ syāt (-) ityāha (-) 


ahetuko'sya nāśaścetprāgevaiṣa vinaśyatu |


prāgeva vinaśyatviti(,) sthityantaramevaiṣa mā darśi (-) ityarthaḥ ||

athocyate nirantarasusadṛśakṣaṇāntarasantativṛttyā dhvasto'pyadhvasta 
ivāste yenādarśanaṃ na yāyāt (-) ityāha (-) 


kṣaṇāntaraṃ sadṛk sūte iti cetsthirataiva sā || 13-57 ||


evaṃ hi santānavṛttyā nirapekṣatayā kṣaṇāntaramārabhamāṇo na tu 
vicchedamadhigacchet (-) ityuktam (-) sthirataiva sā (-) iti | na hi 
asyāntyasyeva ghaṭakṣaṇasya sāmagryantaropanipātaḥ saṃbhāvyate yena 
visadṛśakāryotpāde niranvayo nāśaḥ syāt || 57 ||

etacca malasya nāśamabhyupagamyoktaṃ vastutastvasāvasya na syāt (-) ityāha 
(-) 


na ca nityasya bhāvasya hetvanāyattajanmanaḥ |

