jānīyāditi sarvaḥ sarvajño bhavet (-) iti vastuśūnyaṃ 
śabdaikamātraśaraṇamāvaraṇamuktaṃ syādityuktam (-) (")tathā ca 
syādāvṛtirnāmamātrataḥ(") iti || 65 ||

yadi ca nāmāsya svaśaktipratibandha eva pākastatko'syāḥ pratibandhakaḥ(,) 
īśvaraścet (?) (-) kimasau nirapekṣaḥ pravartate kimuta karmasāmyamapekṣyeti 
(?) nirapekṣaścet sarvānpratyeva tathā syāt (-) ityāha (-) 


roddhryāśca śakteḥ kastasya pratibandhaka īśvaraḥ |

