(-) ityāśaṅkyāha (-) (")lakṣyaḥ(") ityādi | sa caivaṃvidhaḥ kālaḥ 
sukhādivarjanairlakṣyaḥ(,) sarveṣāmeva sukhaduḥkhādyanubhavaśūnyatayā 
svasaṃvedanasiddhaḥ (-) ityarthaḥ || 69 || 

etadeva hi pratikṣipati (-) 


naitatkramikasaṃśuddhavyāmiśrākārakarmabhiḥ |

tathaiva deye svaphale keyamanyo'nyaroddhṛtā || 13-70 ||


