śaktipātapradarśanaṃ nāma trayodaśamāhnikam] || 13 ||

vivecita iti śivam ||


parameśaśaktipātavyaktasvātmīyavīryavaibhavataḥ |

prabhaviṣṇurāhnikārthaṃ trayodaśaṃ jayarathaḥ sphuṭaṃ vyavṛṇot ||



